      "title": "Properly initialize some epan components",
      "message": "Properly initialize some epan components\n\nCreate initialize functions for\n1. Conversation tables\n2. Export objects\n3. Follow stream\n4. RTD tables\n5. SRT tables\n\nso that there doesn't need to be a check when registering objects within those components if their storage structure has been initialized.  This saves the potential of checking if the storage structures exist.\n",
      "author_name": "Michael Mann",
      "author_email": "mmann78@netscape.net",
      "authored_date": "2025-11-10T12:22:29.000-05:00",
